# membership builder JS.js — Membership Builder Page Behavior

## Layman's terms

Powers the normal membership builder: type/tier/family ages → monthly dues, sticker enrollment fee, F&B minimum, and Buy Membership submit.

## Medium understanding

No enrollment discount/promo logic. Shows sticker enrollment next to “One-Time Enrollment Fee.” Discounted / special-offer variants live in `Discounted Enrollment/`.

## Advanced

- **Scope:** Pages/Memberships (Category)/memberships/
- **Live:** paste into WPCode **#9926** (normal join). Discounted enrollment stays on **#7315**.
- **DOM:** `#enrollmentFeeDisplay`, `#priceDisplay`, `#minimumAmount`, `#membershipType`, `#tier`, `#purchaseButton`
- **Naming:** Space in filename; legacy convention
